## Tuning data attribution

Each bundled tuning is ONE documented example, not a canonical or "correct" tuning.
Non-Western tunings vary by region, ensemble, performer, and school. Values are
recorded with cultural context out of respect for their origin communities
(CARE / OCAP principles). Corrections and concerns are welcome via project issues.

